<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">-NAMBYA TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">Chakatondejelwa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Iwhalo Inchena yeChakatondejelwa Kuna Joni</para>
  <para style="toc2">Chakatondejelwa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Chaka</para>
  <para style="mt1">CHAKATONDEJELWA</para>
  <para style="mt3">kuna Joni</para>
  <para style="mt">Matangisilo</para>
  <para style="ip">Iwhalo yeChakatondejelwa ndiyo iwhalo yopejeleja muChivumilano Chipya. Akale ndiyo yakapejeleja kukwalwa kwapinda makole angaba makumi mashanu anamana anamashanu mushule mokuzwalwa kwaJesu, noMpositoli Joni (1:1). Akale ndiye bo wakakwala iNdebo iMbuya yaJoni namakwalo matatu anoti, Joni wotanga, Joni wabili, naJoni watatu. Joni akale wakabezibikana saiye “unodiwa naJesu” (Joni 13:23). Wakakwala iwhalo yaChakatondejelwa eli peChibongo chePatimosi nokuti ndiko kwakabatatamililwa pezhulu pokubhaunula indebo imbuya yaJesu Kristo (Chakatondejelwa 1:9).</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Chinangwa chaJoni pokukwala iwhalo yaChakatondejela ngechokusungwaja babali kuti bebhatilile kudimbwa kunaJesu Kristo akale nokubapa lubimbo nokuti unshaji wokubuya kwaJesu wakabeli pelyo (Chakatondejelwa 1:3, 22:7). Wakabekwalila maKristo wose chiyobo akale edoma makubungano (Chakatondejelwa 2:1, 3:22). Joni unoshoba unkwalilo uwe sechipolofeti (Chakatondejelwa 1:3) akale unoshingisa zwitondejelo zwinji muwhalo iye yose kupandulula zwinhu zwaakabona. Iwhalo inokwendelana nozwimwe zwibabi zweChivumilano Chantolo, saZakaliya ( 6:1-8). Iwhamanda inshanu jine mbili nembiya inshanu jine mbili naijo jilo tojana nempalajo Mwali jaakatumila kulanga iIjipiti (Kubhuda 7—9) .Chakatondejelwa unolebeleka nezwo nshaji wamapejelejo, kuti Jesu unoobhudilila, akale bose bachabiga lubimbo lwabo kwaali banooba bapenyu naye kwemisi isinopela. Yeyi whalo ngiimuchenjeje akale imupe lubimbo kuti Jesu unobuya nokukambijisa.</para>
  <para style="iot">Zwilomumwa</para>
  <para style="io1">Joni unotanga nokuzwileba kuti iye ndiyani akale nokuti wakatambula chini kuboniswa muchipolofita (Chakandondejelwa 1:1-20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unopa undayilo iva kuna iye Jesu kumakubungano mashanu notubili (Chakandondejelwa 1:1—3:22)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kova epandulula imhande ishanu ina tubili akale newhamanda ishanu ina tubili (Chakandondejelwa 4:1—8:5)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mushule mezwi Joni, unopandulula ihondo yomwana wechinhulumyana yaakalwana nechipuka china misholo mishanu ina tubili (Chakandondejelwa 12:1—14:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">kova ekwala pezhulu pobukali lwembiya ishanu jina tubili (Chakandondejelwa 15:1—16:18)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unondila mbeli epandulula kuti Mwali unozunda chini babengi babe kudenga (Chakandondejelwa 17:1—20:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Unopejeleja nokupandulula idenga ibhya nenyika ipya, ichezha kumapejelejo (Chakandondejelwa 21:1—22:21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="REV 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 1:1" />Kutondejelwa kwaJesu Kristo, zwaakapiwa naMwali kutondeja bashingi babe zwinhu zwalukwelela kutikana munshaji umfupi walutobela. Akale wakazibisa nokutuma ingilozi iye kunshingi uwe Joni, <verse eid="REV 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 1:2" />umupa busumikiji kunaizo zwose zwaakabona, yezwi, iWhi lyaMwali akale nobusumikiji bwaJesu Kristo, nokunaizo zwose zwaakabona. <verse eid="REV 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 1:3" />Ulokombolelwa iye unobala mabala obupolofeti yobu newhi lyopezhulu, akale balokombolelwa yabo banowha, akale betobeleja yezwi zwilokwalwa yomo, nokuti unshaji wabapelyo.<verse eid="REV 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumuswa kwamakubungano mashanu anamabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 1:4" />Joni kumakubungano mashanu ana mabili ayiko kuEzhiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:4">Chipiwo nolunyalalo kwamuli luva kwaali iye upo ngweno, akale wakaba eli uchoozha, eva kumipepo mishanu ina mibili, iko mbeli kwechigalo chiche chobushe, <verse eid="REV 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 1:5" />akale kuva kunaJesu Kristo unsumikiji ulobimbika, wembano kumuswa kuna bakafa, akale untongi wamashe opasi lyose.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 1:5">Kuna iye unotida akale wakatisungunula isu muluchinyo lwedu nelopa lilye, <verse eid="REV 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 1:6" />akale wakatita batebuji bobushe, batebuji baMwali Tate babe, kuna iye ngekube lukujo namasimba kwemisi isinopela. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 1:7" />Lingani, iye ukumuzha namakole, akale izhisho lyose linoombona, naibo bose bakombhaya, akale induji jose jopasi jinoolija imhele nozwuzwe, iye. Zwinooba alo. Ameni.<verse eid="REV 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 1:8" />“Imi ndimi matangisilo, Alufa, nejibilo, Omega,” unodalo She Mwali, upo ngweno, wakabelipo, uchoozha, iye Samasimba.<verse eid="REV 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chibono chaKristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 1:9" />Imi, Joni, mwanakwaina nonkwaina wenu, unokobelana namwi munaJesu, mumasheto, nomubushe akale nomwoyondefu okuzwisimisa, ndakabeli pechibongo chinowhi Patimosi pezhulu pewhi lyaMwali akale nobusumikiji bwaJesu. <verse eid="REV 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 1:10" />Imi ndakabeli muMpepo nezhuba lyaShe, akale ndakawha iwhi mushule mwangu linanga solukwembo, <verse eid="REV 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 1:11" />lyakati, “Kwala zwaubweni muwhalo akale uyitumije kumakubungano mashanu ana mabili, kuEfesu, kuSimina, kuPegamamu, kuTiyatila, kuSadisi, kuFiladelufiya nokuLawudisiya.”<verse eid="REV 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 1:12" />Kova ndichingunuka kuti ndibone iwhi yelyo lyakabelebeleka nami. Pandakachingunuka ndakabona zwigajiko zwezwimuniko zwendalama zwishanu zwinazwibili, <verse eid="REV 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 1:13" />mukati mwezwo zwigajiko zwezwimuniko, pakabeli unanga soMwananhulumyana wonhu, akambala chimbalo chilefu nebhanti lyendalama pechifuba chiche. <verse eid="REV 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 1:14" />Ivuji lilye munsholo lyakabeli ijena sobukuse bwemwizi inchena, kuchena sechivulamabwe chinyolo, mesho awe akabeli sontutumo womoto, <verse eid="REV 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 1:15" />makumbo awe akabeli sengula ilokwijingwa, yava mumoto wevuto, akale iwhi lilye lyakabeli sontimbo wamapopoma evula. <verse eid="REV 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 1:16" />Muluboko lulwe lolulyi wakabakabhata inyenyeji ishanu jinembili, mundomo uwe mwakabhuda igwalabaza linopiza linocheka kwosekwose, akale chiso chiche chakabepenya sezhuba pakati pamasikati. <verse eid="REV 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 1:17" />Pandakoombona, ndakawila pasi pamakumbo awe sonhu wafa. Koga iye wakabiga luboko lulwe lolulyi panami, akati “Usitye! Ndimi wotanga akale ndimi wopejeleja. <verse eid="REV 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 1:18" />Ndimpenyu! Ndakabafa, akale ilinga ngweno, ndimpenyu kwemisi isinopela. Akale ndimi ndina chikonyeso cholufu nokubugalo bwabakafa. <verse eid="REV 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 1:19" />Nokudalo, kwala zwawabona, zwipo ngweno nozwichatobela mushule. <verse eid="REV 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 1:20" />Isiswa lyenyenyeji ishanu jinembili jiwabona muluboko lwangu lwokululyi nezwigajiko zwezwimuniko zwendalama zwishanu nezwibili inyenyeji ishanu nembili, ingilozi jamakubungano mashanu ana mabili, akale zwigajiko zwezwimuniko zwishanu zwina zwibili ndiwo makubungano mashanu ana mabili.”<verse eid="REV 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="REV 2" />
  <para style="s">Chilayilo kuEfesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 2:1" />“Kwalila Ingilozi yokugubungano lyokuEfesu uti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:1">“Yaya mawhi oyo ulobhata inyenyeji ishanu jine mbili muluboko lulwe lolulyi, unokwendenda pakati pozwigajiko zwendalama zwozwimuniko zwishanu zwinazwibili. <verse eid="REV 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 2:2" />Ndoyiziba mishingo yenu, kushinga kwenu nesimba nokusimilila, nemyoyo yenu milefu. Akale nokuso whanana nabanhu babi, koga mwakakweja yabo baluzwiti bapositoli koga besili ibo, akale mukawana kuti ngibamaniepwa. <verse eid="REV 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 2:3" />Ndoziba kuti unozwisimisa nomwoyondefu, akale uzwisimisila izina lyangu, akale aujimunyajwa nazwo. <verse eid="REV 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 2:4" />Koga ndina nechi chandino nyunyuta kunawi, kuti wakalasha ludo luwakabeli nalo pakutanga. <verse eid="REV 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 2:5" />Kumbulukwa ngweno kuti wakawa chini, zwifije ute mishingo yawakabeta pakutanga. Ungosozwita, ndoozha kwauli ndibhise chigajiko chicho chechimuniko pabugalo pachili. <verse eid="REV 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 2:6" />Koga yechi chibuya una nacho, unobenga mishingo yamaNikolayiteni, yandinobenga bo.<verse eid="REV 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 2:7" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe kuti uMpepo umutini kumakubungano!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:7">“Kuna yoyo unozunda ndoomvumija kuti elye michelo yonti wobupenyu, umo mupaladiso yaMwali.<verse eid="REV 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayilo kuSimina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 2:8" />“Kwalila ingilozi yegubungano lyokuSimina, uti,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:8">“Mawhi anova kunoyo wokutanga nookujibija, iye wakafa akale akamuka. <verse eid="REV 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 2:9" />‘Ndokuziba kuyabiswa kuko akale nobusheti bubo, koga umfumi akale nechipito chaabo banozwiti baJuda, besiibo koga beli isinagogo yaSatani. <verse eid="REV 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 2:10" />Usitye busheti bwalobokuswikila. Ilinga, guluzhanje waloboposela bamwe benu muntolongo, kuti mukwejwe, kwamazhuba aligumi unoba mumasheto. Iwi bimbika kuswikila palufu, akale imi ndokupa bupenyu senhulu yokukoma.’”<verse eid="REV 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 2:11" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe kuti uMpepo umutini kumakubungano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:11">“Iye uchazunda aatolwajiswa nolufu lwabili.”<verse eid="REV 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilayilo kuPegamamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 2:12" />“Kwalila ingilozi yegubungano lyokuPegamamu uti:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:12">“Yaya mawhi awe iye unegwalabaza linopiza linocheka kwosekwose. <verse eid="REV 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 2:13" />Ndokuziba kwaunogala, ndiko kunachigalo chobushe chaSatani. Koga ulobhatilila muzina lyangu akale aujakalamba kudimbwa kuko kunami kana mumazhuba aAntipasi, unsumikiji wangu ulobimbika, wakabulayiwa muguta lyenu, mwanogala Satani. <verse eid="REV 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 2:14" />Koga ndinazwishoma zwandinonyunyuta kwauli, unabamwe balobhatilila indayijo yaBhalamu, wakalayija Bhalaki kuteya bana baIzilayeli, kuti belye kulya kwakabapilwa kuzwimwali akale nokuta busangu. <verse eid="REV 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 2:15" />Nezwo iwi una bamwe balobhatilila kundayijo yamaNikolayiteni. <verse eid="REV 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 2:16" />Nezwo shanduka. Kungosoba alo, ndoozha kwauli nokukambijisa, akale ndoolwana nabo negwalabaza londomo wangu.”<verse eid="REV 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 2:17" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe kuti uMpepo umulebani kumakubungano.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:17">“Kuna yoyo uchazunda ndoompa imwe yemana ilosisika, akale ndoompa ibwe ijena, nezina ibhya lilokwalwa pebwe yelo lisinozibwa noomwe kuzhe kooyo uchalitambula.”<verse eid="REV 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Indayilo kuTiyatila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 2:18" />“Kwalila ingilozi yegubungano lyokuTiyatila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 2:18">“Yaya ndiwo mawhi oMwananhulumyana waMwali, unamesho anangasontutumo womoto, makumbo awe anangasengula ilokwijingwa. <verse eid="REV 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 2:19" />Ndoiziba mishingo iyo, ludo lulo, kudimbwa, bushingili nokugontama kuko kokubhatilila. Akale nokuti mishingo iyo yangweno inopinda yotanga. <verse eid="REV 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 2:20" />Koga ndina nezwi zwandinonyunyuta kwauli, kuti iwi unotobelejelana nonhukaji yoyu Jezebhelu, unozwishoba kuti umpolofetikaji. Umulayija nokuchengela bashingi bangu kuti besanguke akale kuti belye zwapilwa kuzwimwali. <verse eid="REV 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 2:21" />Ndakompa unshaji kuti eshanduke, koga ukumulamba kusiya busangu bubwe. <verse eid="REV 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 2:22" />Ilinga, ndoomposela pabulo bobulwaji, akale nayabo banopombola naye ndoobaposela mumasheto makulwana, kuzhe kokuti beshanduke muzwito zwabo. <verse eid="REV 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 2:23" />Lingani, ndoobulaya bana babe. Makubungano wose ndipo paachoziba kuti ndimi iye unopenyengula indangalilo nemyoyo, akale ndoolipa umwe noumwe nezwino kwendelana nemishingo iye.”<verse eid="REV 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 2:24" />‘Koga mubunji bwenu muTiyatila amujakatobela indayijo yeyi yobubi, musanu mwabhatilila kundayijo jilomila muzwinhu zwaSatani, kunamwi ndoti, anditobiga umwe untolo pezhulu penu. <verse eid="REV 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 2:25" />Ibhatililani chete kuna zwamunanazwo, ndijine ndibuye. <verse eid="REV 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 2:26" />Iye unozunda akale elondota mishingo yangu kuswikila kumapejelejo, ndoompa isimba pezhulu penduji, <verse eid="REV 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 2:27" />akale unoobatonga nonzato wensimbi, sezwinotikana kana ihali ipwachaulwa mutubabi, <verse eid="REV 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="REV 2:28" />sezwo ndakatambula isimba liva kunaTate bangu, neebo ndoopa intanda.<verse eid="REV 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="REV 2:29" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe zwimulebwa noMpepo kumakubungano.”<verse eid="REV 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="REV 3" />
  <para style="s">Chilayilo kuGubungano lyokuSadisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 3:1" />“Kungilozi yegubungano lyokuSadisi kwala uti</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:1">“Yaya ndiwo mawhi awe iye una mipepo mishanu ina mibili yaMwali akale nenyenyeji ishanu jinembili. Ndoziba mishingo iyo, unezina lyokuti umpenyu, koga ulofa. <verse eid="REV 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 3:2" />Sokudalo imuka, usimise zwasala akale sezwo wabulofa, nokuti andijanu ndawana mishingo iyo ikapelelela mumesho aMwali wangu. <verse eid="REV 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 3:3" />Kumbulukwa akale zwawakatambula nokuwha, zwilondote yezwi, akale shanduka. Ukasoomuka, ndoozha sembava, akale autobe uziba unshaji undichakuswikila. <verse eid="REV 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 3:4" />Koga uchina mazina mashoma muSadisi, abanhu basakaswibhisa zwimbalo zwabo, bachookwenda nami muzwimbalo zwichena, nokuti balokwelela. <verse eid="REV 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 3:5" />Iye unozunda unoombala zwimbalo zwichena saibo, akale anditoolijima izina lilye muwhalo yobupenyu, ndoolibanda mbeli kwaTate bangu nambeli kwengilozi jabo.<verse eid="REV 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 3:6" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe zwimulebwa noMpepo kumakubungano”<verse eid="REV 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Undayilo kuFiladelufiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 3:7" />“Kungilozi yegubungano lyokuFiladelufiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:7">“Mawhi awe iye unchena, wechokomende, unanekii yaDavidi, unozhula koga akuna unokonya kana unozhula. <verse eid="REV 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 3:8" />Ndoiziba mishingo iyo. Ilinga, ndakuzhulila unkoba, pasina unotubula kuukonya, ndoziba kuti unamasimba mashoma, koga walilondota iwhi lyangu akale aujakalilamba izina lyangu. <verse eid="REV 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 3:9" />Ndoota kuti yabo besinagogi yaSatani banozwiti baJuda ibo besili ibo, koga beniepa, ndoota kuti bezhe bookotama mbeli kwamakumbo awo, akale kuti uzibe kuti ndokuda. <verse eid="REV 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 3:10" />Iwi wakalondota kulaya kwangu wakasungwala nokubhatilila, ndookulondota ponshaji wokukwejwa umuzha penyika yose, kootonga yabo banogala penyika. <verse eid="REV 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 3:11" />Ndikumuzha nokukambijisa. Bhatisisa nesimba zwauna nazwo, kutila kuti pesibe nouchavupula inhulu iyo. <verse eid="REV 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 3:12" />Iye unozunda, ndoonta kuti ebe idabililo mutempeli lyaMwali wangu, aatobhuda kuzhe kwalyo, akale ndookwala izina lyaMwali wangu pana iye, akale nezina lyeguta lyaMwali wangu, iJelusalema ibhya lichabhuluka liva kudenga kunaMwali wangu, akale nezina lyangu ibhya.”<verse eid="REV 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 3:13" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe zwimulebwa noMpepo kumakubungano!”<verse eid="REV 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Undayilo kuLayodesiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 3:14" />“Kungilozi yegubungano lyokuLayodesiya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 3:14">“Yaya mawhi aAmeni, unsumikiji ulobimbika akale unsumikiji wechokomende, untongi webumbilo lyaMwali. <verse eid="REV 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 3:15" />Ndoiziba mishingo iyo, autotonhola akale autopisa. Kuda kwangu ngikwokuti, ngana utonhola kana upisa! <verse eid="REV 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 3:16" />Nokudalo, nokuti unojiya, autotonhola kana kupisa, ndalebo kufha ndikubhisa mundomo mwangu! <verse eid="REV 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 3:17" />Iwi unoti, ‘Ndilofuma, ndilobhudilila, akale apana chandinoshaka.’ Koga usinoziba kuti uloshulukilwa, unowisa ishe, unoyabula , ubhofu akale ulichinkuna. <verse eid="REV 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 3:18" />Nokudalo ndokupa mano, kuti utenge kunami indalama ilokwijingwa nomoto, kuti ufume, akale zwimbalo zwichena kuti umbale, usise bunkuna bubo bunopisa ishoni, akale dila mafuta mumesho, kuti ubone. <verse eid="REV 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 3:19" />Yabo bandinoda, ndobalaya akale ndobalanga, neezwo sungwalani akale mushanduke. <verse eid="REV 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 3:20" />Lingani! ndimile pankoba akale ndimugogoja, kana pelina uchawha iwhi lyangu akale ezhule unkoba, ndongwina mukati akale ndilye naye, akale naiye elye nami. <verse eid="REV 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 3:21" />Iye unozunda, ndoompa kuti egale nami pechigalo chobushe, sezwo Imi ndakazunda akale ndikagala pechigalo chobushe chaTate bangu pechigalo chabo chobushe.<verse eid="REV 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 3:22" />“Iye unenzebe, ngewhe zwimulebwa noMpepo kumakubungano”<verse eid="REV 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="REV 4" />
  <para style="s">Kunamata kudenga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 4:1" />Mushule mwezwi mbeli kwangu ndakawana ndikalingana, nedendele lilozhulika kudenga.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 4:1">Akale iwhi lyotanga lindakabawha lilebeleka kwandili solukwembo, lyakati, “Izhila pezhulu yokuno, akale ndikutondeje zwichatikana mushule mwezwi.” <verse eid="REV 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 4:2" />Pakalepo ndakangwina muMpepo, akale mbeli kwangu kwakabeli nechigalo chobushe kudenga, kuli noumwe wakabeli gele pachili! <verse eid="REV 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 4:3" />Yoyo wakabeligele pechigalo wakabelingika sebwe linokosha linowhi jasipa akale nelimwe linowhi kaneliyeni linabukandi, akale sebwe linokosha lye emaradi lina bushaba. Ijinga linolingika sebwe linokosha, lizyunguluka chigalo chobushe. <verse eid="REV 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 4:4" />Kuzyunguluka chigalo chobushe kwakabakuli nezwigalo zwobushe makumi mabili anazwina, akale pazwigalo yezwi pakabeli gele bakulwana makumi mabili ana mana, bakambala ingubo inchena, nechilemba chendalama pamisholo yabo. <verse eid="REV 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 4:5" />Kuva pechigalo chobushe kwakabeli kumweka kolupalanganda, kunguluma nokudilima kukulwana, akale mbeli kwechigalo chobushe kumututuma zwimuniko zwishanu zwina zwibili zwomoto, yeyi ndiyo mipepo mishanu nemibili yaMwali, <verse eid="REV 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 4:6" />akale mbeli kwechigalo chobushe pana zwinolingika segungwa lyamagilazi, linobelengela sebwe lilokosha lyekristali. Pakati nomumbali mwechigalo chobushe, peli nezwipuka zwina zwipenyu, zwizhele mesho mbeli nomushule. <verse eid="REV 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 4:7" />Chipuka chipenyu chotanga chinanga seshumba, chabili chipuka chipenyu chinanga senkabe, chetatu chipuka chipenyu china chiso chonhu, akale chechina chipuka chipenyu chinanga chipungu chimupululuka. <verse eid="REV 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 4:8" />Chimwe nechimwe chezwipuka zwina zwipenyu, chakabeli namapapilo mashanu analimwempela, akale zwilizhele mesho alozyunguluka kose nomukati, akale masikati nobusiku azwitolekeja kukwimba zwiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:8">“Unchena, unchena, unchena, She Mwali wamasimba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:8">wakaba elipo, upo akale uchoobuya.!”<verse eid="REV 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 4:9" />Akale zwipuka zwipenyu pazwinopa lukujo nolulemekejo akale nokuboka kuna iye ugele pechigalo chobushe, umpenyu kwemisi isinopela, <verse eid="REV 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 4:10" />bakulwana makumi mabili nabana banofhugama mbeli kukwe ugele pechigalo chobushe akale boonamata iye una bupenyu businopela, banobiga inhulu mbeli kwechibhula chobushe, bekwimba,<verse eid="REV 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 4:11" />“ She Mwali wedu, ulokwelela iwi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">kuwana lukujo nolulemekejo nesimba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 4:11">nokuti wakabumba zwinhu zwose,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 4:11">akale nechido chicho zwakabaipo akale zwakabumbwa.”<verse eid="REV 4:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="REV 5" />
  <para style="s">Iwhalo neMhwizana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 5:1" />Akale ndakabona muluboko lolulyi, loyo wakabeligele pechigalo chobushe iwhalo ilokwalwa mukati nokushule, ilonamwa nezwi namatijo zwishanu zwina zwibili. <verse eid="REV 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 5:2" />Akale ndakabona ingilozi ina masimba ipupula newhi lyopezhulu iti, “Ndiyani ulokwelela kukwatanula imhande nokuzhula iwhalo?” <verse eid="REV 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 5:3" />Koga akuna unhu kudenga kana penyika kana pasi penyika wakabetubula kuzhula iwhalo kana kulinga mukati mwayo. <verse eid="REV 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 5:4" />Ndakalila kasa nokuti akujakawanika ulokwelela kuzhula iwhalo kana kulinga mukati mwayo. <verse eid="REV 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 5:5" />Kova umwe wabakulwana eti kwandili, “Usilile, iShumba yoluji lwaJuda, chizekululu chaDavidi, wakazunda, kutila kuti ezhule iwhalo akale nezwi namatijo zwalo zwishanu zwina zwibili.”<verse eid="REV 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 5:6" />Pakati pechigalo chobushe akale nezwipuka zwipenyu zwina, mukati mwabakulwana, ndakabona iMhwizana ilimile, iboneka sokuti yakabulayiwa, iline mbizho ishanu jinembili akale namesho mashanu ana mabili, yeyi ili mipepo mishanu ina mibili yaMwali yakatumwa munyika yose. <verse eid="REV 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 5:7" />Wakenda akatola iwhalo kuluboko lolulyi lwaiye wakabeligele pechigalo chobushe. <verse eid="REV 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 5:8" />Paakatola iwhalo, zwipuka zwipenyu zwina akale nabakulwana makumi mabili nabana bakafigama pasi mbeli kweMhwizana, umwe noumwe akabhata kadende, nembiya jendalama jizhele ifhungayijo, iliiyo minamato yabachena, <verse eid="REV 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 5:9" />akale bakakwimba lwimbo lupya beti.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">“Iwi ndiwi ulokwelela kutola iwhalo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">akale nokukwatunula inhembe yayo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:9">nokuti iwi wakabulayiwa akale nelopa lilyo Mwali wakontengela banhu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:9">banova kunduji jose, nendimi nomubanhu akale nenyika,<verse eid="REV 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 5:10" />akale ukabata kuti bebebushe, batebuji baMwali wedu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:10">akale banootonga penyika.”<verse eid="REV 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 5:11" />Ndakalinga akale ndikawha iwhi lyengilozi inji, jisinobalika akale zwiulu nezwiulu, zwilopamwa makumi ezwiulu alopamwa kabili makumi ezwiulu. Ingilozi jakakomboloja chibhula chobushe, nomuzwipuka zwipenyu nokubakulwana. <verse eid="REV 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 5:12" />Newhi lipo pezhulu beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:12">“Ilokwelela Imhwizana yakabulayiwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">kutambula isimba, bufumi, buchenjevu, butongi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:12">lukujo, kungaima nokutunhumwijwa!”<verse eid="REV 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 5:13" />Ndipo pandakawha zwipuka zwose zwokudenga, nozwo penyika, nozwa pasi penyika, nomugungwa, naizwo zwose zwino gala mukati zwiti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 5:13">“Kuna iye ugele pechigalo chobushe nokuMhwizana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">ngekube kutunwa, lukujo, kungaima, nesimba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 5:13">kwemisi isinopela!”<verse eid="REV 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 5:14" />Zwipuka zwipenyu zwina zwakati, “Ameni!” akale bakulwana bakafhigama akale bakanamata.<verse eid="REV 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="REV 6" />
  <para style="s">Imhande</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 6:1" />Ngweno ndakabona Imhwizana payakazhula chimwe chemhande ishanu nembili, ndakawha chimwe chezwipuka zwipenyu zwina chiti, “Izha!” newhi linanga kudilima. <verse eid="REV 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 6:2" />Akale ndikabona, ilingani ibhiza ijena, nongadi walyo wakabelina kadantambwe, akale wakapiwa chilemba, akenda ezunda nokunozunda.<verse eid="REV 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 6:3" />Paakazhula imhande yebili, ndakawha chipuka chipenyu chabili chiti, “Izha!” <verse eid="REV 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 6:4" />Akale kwakabhuda limwe ibhiza, ishaba pilibili, ungadi walyo wakavumilwa kubhisa lunyalalo munyika, kuti banhu bebulayane, akale akapiwa igwalabaza igulwana kasakasa.<verse eid="REV 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 6:5" />IMwizana payakazhula imhande yatatu, ndakawha chipuka chipenyu chatatu chiti, “Izha!” Ndakalinga ndikabona, ibhiza idema, akale ungadi walyo wakabeli nechikelo muluboko lulwe, <verse eid="REV 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 6:6" />akale ndakawha zwinanga iwhi pakati pezwipuka zwipenyu liti, “Chikamu chechina chekoloni chinota idola, akale zwikamu zwitatu pazwina zwebhali zwinota idola, koga usibulaye miti ye olivi neyemizhambi.”<verse eid="REV 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 6:7" />IMwizana payakazhula imhande yechina, ndakawha iwhi lyechipuka chipenyu chechina chiti, “Izha!” <verse eid="REV 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 6:8" />Ndakalinga ndikabona, ibhiza lilochenuluka, akale izina lyongadi walyo waluwhi Kufa, akale bugalo bwabafi, yakabontobela, akale bakapiwa masimba pezhulu pechikamu chimwempela muzwikamu zwina ipasi lyose, kubulaya negwalabaza, nenzhala namalwaji akale nemhuka jeshango jopenyika.<verse eid="REV 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 6:9" />Imhwizana payakazhula imhande yeshanu, ndakabona mudako lyedebulilo mipepo yaabo bakabulayilwa iwhi lyaMwali akale nobusumukiji bwabo, <verse eid="REV 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 6:10" />bakashomeja newhi lipopezhulu beti, “O Iwi Tezi Upezhuluzhulu, unchena akale uchokomende, uchatola unshajini usanu wata untongo wuwo usanu wabwilizila ilopa lyedu kunaabo bagele munyika?” <verse eid="REV 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 6:11" />Pakalepo umwenoumwe wakapiwa chimbalo chichena akale akabujwa kuti enyetutukwe konshaji ulopamijilwa, kujine kuti bunji bwabo bashingikwaina nabanakwaina babo balobulayiwa saibo bapelelela.<verse eid="REV 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 6:12" />Ndakabona imwizana izhula imhande yashanu nemwempela, kwakaba nokudedema kwenyika kukulwana, izhuba lyakaswibha sesaka lyobukuse buloswibha sobwembuji, mweji uzhele wakashapala selopa, <verse eid="REV 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 6:13" />akale inyenyeji jokudenga jakawila penyika sonkuyu umbweja ihuyu pemhepo udengunujwa nebhepo, <verse eid="REV 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 6:14" />idenga lyakabwandila solukwalo lwapetwa, ose matunhu nezwibongo zwakabhiswa pabugalo bwazwo. <verse eid="REV 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 6:15" />Pakalepo mashe openyika, banhu bakulwana, batungamili babalwi, bafumi, banesimba, akale naibo bwose, balanda nabalosununguka, bakabwata mumapako nomumabwe amatunhu, <verse eid="REV 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 6:16" />beshobelela kumatunhu nokumabwe, beti, “Tichigeni mutisise kumesho kwoyo ugele pechigalo chobushe, nomukunyetela kweMhwizana, <verse eid="REV 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 6:17" />nokuti izhuba igulwana lyokunyema kwabo lyaswika, akale ndiyani angama mbeli kwalyo?”<verse eid="REV 6:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="REV 7" />
  <para style="s">Imhande yabashingi baMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 7:1" />Mushule mwezwi ndakabona ingilozi ina, jilimile kumatibi mana enyika, jitabilija mipepo mina yopenyika, kuti pesibe ibhepo lichapunga penyika, mugungwa kana nokumiti. <verse eid="REV 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 7:2" />Pakalepo ndakabona imwe ingilozi iva kubhazu lokubuve izhuba, nemhande yaMwali umpenyu, akale ikashomeja newhi lyopezhulu kungilozi ina jakapiwa isimba lyokuchinya inyika negungwa, <verse eid="REV 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 7:3" />iti, “Musichinye inyika kana igungwa nemiti, kuswikila tabiga imhande pehuma jabashingi baMwali.” <verse eid="REV 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 7:4" />Ndakachiwha chilabo chabakabigwa imhande, izana lozwiulu namakumi mana anazwiulu zwina, beva muluji lwose lwabana banhulumyana baIzilayeli, <verse eid="REV 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 7:5" />boluji lwaJuda bakabeli igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili bakabigwa imhande, boluji lwaRubheni igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, boluji lwaGadi igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, <verse eid="REV 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 7:6" />boluji lwaAsha, igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, boluji lwaNafutali igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili boluji lwaManase, <verse eid="REV 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 7:7" />igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili boluji lwaSimioni, igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili boluji lwaLevi, igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili boluji lwaIsaka, <verse eid="REV 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 7:8" />boluji lwaZebhuloni igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, boluji lwaJosefa igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili, boluji lwaBhenjamini igumi lyozwiulu nozwiulu zwibili.<verse eid="REV 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Luvute Lukulwana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 7:9" />Mushule mwezwi ndakalinga, akale ndakabona luvute lusinotubulika kulabwa nonhu, luva munyika jose, luva munduji jose nomubanhu nomundimi jose, belimile mbeli kwechibhula chobushe akale mbeli kweMhwizana. Bakambala zwimbalo zwichena, beli nenhabi jamalala mumaboko abo, <verse eid="REV 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 7:10" />akale beshomeja namawhi opezhulu beti, “Luchijo ngolwaMwali wedu, unogala pechigalo chobushe, akale ngubwe Mhwizana!” <verse eid="REV 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 7:11" />iNgilozi jose jakama jikazyunguluka chibhula chobushe akale jikazyunguluka bakulwana bezwibumbwa zwina zwipenyu, akale bakalala nechisopasi mbeli kwechibhula chobushe jikanamata Mwali, <verse eid="REV 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 7:12" />jiti, “Ameni! Makombolelo, kungaima, buchenjevu, kuboka, lukujo nesimba nobukulwana kunaMwali wedu kwemisi isinopela! Ameni.”<verse eid="REV 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 7:13" />Pakalepo umwe wabakulwana wakalebeleka kwandili eti, “Ndibaani yaba, balombala ingubo inchena, akale bakumuva kupi!”<verse eid="REV 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 7:14" />Ndakati kwaali, “Shungwasha, mwoziba.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 7:14">Akati kwandili, “Yaba ndibo bakava mumasheto makulwana kasakasa, bakapopa ingubo jabo mulopa lyeMhwizana jikabenchena. <verse eid="REV 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 7:15" />Nokudalo ndizwo belimbeli kwechibhula chobushe chaMwali, bonshingila busiku namasikati mutempeli lilye, akale unogala pechigalo chobushe unooba fukatila. <verse eid="REV 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 7:16" />Abachinoofa nezhala, kana inyota akale nezhuba alitoobapisa, kana kunyeza kuli chini, <verse eid="REV 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 7:17" />nokuti iMhwizana ipopakati pechigalo chobushe inooba undyisi wabo, akale inooba tondeja kumashawi evula imhenyu, akale Mwali unoochumula mishoji yose mumesho abo.”<verse eid="REV 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="REV 8" />
  <para style="s">IMhande yashanu nembili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 8:1" />Imwizana payakazhula imhande yashanu inembili, kwakaba nokunyalala kudenga kungaba chikamu che awa. <verse eid="REV 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 8:2" />Pakalepo ndikabona ingilozi ishanu jinembili jinoma mbeli kwaMwali, nenkwembo ishanu jinembili jakapiwa kwajili.<verse eid="REV 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 8:3" />Akale imwe ingilozi yakezha ikama pe debulilo lina chifhungaiso chendalama, nenfhungaijo inji kuti ishanganiswe neminamato yabachena bose pedebulilo lyendalama mbeli kwechibhula chobushe, <verse eid="REV 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 8:4" />akale busi bwefhungaijo bwakanyamuka buli neminamato yabachena zwiva muluboko lwengilozi mbeli kwaMwali. <verse eid="REV 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 8:5" />Pakalepo ingilozi yakatola chifungaijio ikachizhaja nomoto unova pedebulilo ikaposela penyika, akale kukaba nokudilima, kunguluma, kumweeka kolupalanganda, akale nokudengeda kwenyika.<verse eid="REV 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mikwembo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 8:6" />Ngweno ingilozi ishanu jinembili jakabelina mikwembo mishanu inemibili jakalonganyila kulija.<verse eid="REV 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 8:7" />Ingilozi yotanga yakalija lukwembo lwayo, kukatobela chivulamabwe nomoto, zwiloshangana nelopa, zwakambwejelwa penyika, akale chibabi chatatu chenyika chakapiswa, akale chibabi chatatu chemiti chakapya, akale nobuhwa bunyolo bose bwakapya.<verse eid="REV 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 8:8" />Ingilozi yabili yakalija lukwembo lwayo, akale chinangedunhu igulwana, chitutuma moto, chakaposelwa mugungwa, akale chibabi chetatu chegungwa chakaba ilopa, <verse eid="REV 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 8:9" />chibabi chatatu chezwibumbwa zwipenyu mugungwa zwakafa, nechibabi chatatu chobwato chakapalajwa.<verse eid="REV 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 8:10" />Ingilozi yatatu yakalija lukwembo lwayo, inyenyeji ihulwana kasakasa yakawa iva kudenga, itutuma sechimuniko, akale ikawila pechibabi chatatu chenjizi namashawi evula. <verse eid="REV 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 8:11" />Izina lyenyenyeji linowhi “nshashanyama”. Chibabi chatatu chevula chakababa, akale banhu banji bakabulayiwa nevula yeyi, nokuti yakabababa.<verse eid="REV 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 8:12" />Ingilozi yechina yakalija lukwembo lwayo, chibabi chatatu chezhuba chakabola, nechibabi chatatu chomweji, nechibabi chatatu chenyenyeji, kutila kuti chibabi chatatu chokumunika kwazo chakabe nhilima, chibabi chetatu chamasikati chakajimwa, nechibabi chatatu chobusiku.<verse eid="REV 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 8:13" />Kova ndilinga, akale ndikawha ipungu lilila newhi lipo pezhulu kasa, lipululuka mudenga pezhulu kasa, liti“Masheto, masheto, masheto kunaabo banogala penyika, nokuti ingilozi inhatu kana jabulolija”<verse eid="REV 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="REV 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 9:1" />Ingilozi yashanu yakalija lukwembo lwayo, akale ndikabona inyenyeji yakabambwela iva kudenga izha penyika, akale yakapiwa chikonyiso chedizwa linomila kusinojiba. <verse eid="REV 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 9:2" />Yakazhula idizwa linomila kusinojiba, akale mudizwa mwakabhuda busi bunanga bwevuto igulwana kasa, akale izhuba nompepo zwakaswibhiswa nobusi bwakava mudizwa. <verse eid="REV 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 9:3" />Pakalepo mubusi mwakabhuda imhashu jizha penyika, akale jakapiwa isimba linanga lyemhami jomunyika. <verse eid="REV 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 9:4" />Jakabujwa kuti jisichinye buhwa bwenyika kana chinomela chose chinyolo kana unti wechimo chipi, koga jinangane chete nabanhu basina imhande yaMwali pehuma jabo. <verse eid="REV 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 9:5" />Imhashu jakavumilwa kubayangatisa kwemyeji mishanu, koga jisinobabulaya, akale kuyabisa kwajo kwakaba kuli soluyabiso lwemhami, painoluma unhu. <verse eid="REV 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 9:6" />Akale mumazhuba yawo banhu banoopota lufu koga abatooluwana, banooda kufa, asi lufu lunoopululuka lubatizha.<verse eid="REV 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 9:7" />Mukulingika imhashu jakabeli samabhiza alolongelwa ihondo, pamisholo yajo pakabelina zwakabelingika sejinhulu jendalama, chiso chajo chakabeli sokwabanhu, <verse eid="REV 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 9:8" />masusu ajo samasusu abanhukaji, nameno ajo sameno eshumba, <verse eid="REV 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 9:9" />jilina mapande anange nsimbi jopefuba, akale unkuwaluzha wamapapilo ajo wakaba uli sowengolo inji namabhiza zwingwina muhondo. <verse eid="REV 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 9:10" />Jina myise inoluma seyemhami, akale isimba lyajo lyoyabisa banhu kwemyeji mishanu liko kumyise. <verse eid="REV 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 9:11" />Ingilozi ndiye She wajo wegwizhana linomila kusinojiba, izina lyayo muchiHebhelu ndiAbhadoni, muchiGiliki unowhi Apoloni.<verse eid="REV 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 9:12" />Injabulo yotanga yapinda, ilingani, injabulo imbili jichinozha.<verse eid="REV 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 9:13" />Pakalepo ingilozi yashanu nemwempela yakalija lukwembo lwayo, ndikawha iwhi liva mumbizho ina jedebulilo lyendalama mbeli kwaMwali, <verse eid="REV 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 9:14" />liti kungilozi yashanu nemwempela yakabelina lukwembo, “Sungunula ingilozi ina jilo sungililwa palwizi lukulwana iYufuletisi.” <verse eid="REV 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 9:15" />Nokudalo ingilozi ina jakasungunulwa, jakabakabambilwa iawa, izhuba, mweji negole, kubulaya chikamu chatatu chabanhu. <verse eid="REV 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 9:16" />Bunji bwabalwi bamabhiza bwakabepama tubili pegumi lyozwiulu lilopamhwa kaligumi kozwiulu, ndakabuwha bunji bwabo. <verse eid="REV 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 9:17" />Akale yeyi ndiyo inzila yandabona mabhiza yaya mumbono wangu, bagadi bakabakambala inhibi jopefuba jinalubala lomoto akale nesafaya nesalifa, akale misholo yamabhiza yakaba ili semisholo yeshumba, akale elimashaba somoto nobusi akale, sewhakwa zwakaba zwibhuda mumilomo yamabhiza. <verse eid="REV 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 9:18" />Ishulamatongo yeji inhatu, chikamu chetatu chabanhu penyika chakabulayiwa, nomoto nobusi nesalufa yakabebhuda mumilomo yawo. <verse eid="REV 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 9:19" />Nokuti isimba lyamabhiza lyakabeli mumilomo yawo nemimwise yakabeli senyoka, elina misholo, akale nemisholo yayo ilwajisa banhu.<verse eid="REV 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 9:20" />Bunji bwabanhu, basakabulayiwa neeji ishulamatongo, abajaka zwifija mumishingo yamaboko abo kana kulekeja kunamata madimoni akale nezwimwali zwendalama nesiliva nengula namabwe nezwikunyana, zwisinobona, kana kuwha,kana kukwenda, <verse eid="REV 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 9:21" />abajaka zwifija, mububulayi bwabo, bulowi bwabo, mubusangu bwabo, nomukukwiba kwabo.<verse eid="REV 9:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="REV 10" />
  <para style="s">Ingilozi nakaKwalo katukutuku</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 10:1" />Pakalepo ndakabona imwe ingilozi inesimba kasakasa izha iva kudenga, yaka putilijwa negole, nejinga pansholo wayo, akale kumesho kwayo kwakabeli sezhuba, akale makumbo ayo akabeli samatabilijo omoto. <verse eid="REV 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 10:2" />Yakabeli nakakwalo katukutuku kalozhulwa muluboko lwayo. Ikabiga igumbo lyayo lolulyi mugungwa, akale igumbo lyechesho likatoba penyika, <verse eid="REV 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 10:3" />yakashomeja newhi lyopezhulu, seshumba imunguluma, payakashomeja, mitimbo mishanu inamibili yakadabila idilima. <verse eid="REV 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 10:4" />Akale payakati yadilima mitimbo mishanu inamibili, ndakaba ndalibo kwala, koga ndakawha iwhi liva kudenga liti, “Ita zwalebwa nemitimbo mishanu inamibili libesiswa, akale usizwikwale.”<verse eid="REV 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 10:5" />Akale ingilozi yandakabona ilimile pegungwa nopenyika yakanyamulila luboko lwayo lolulyi kudenga, <verse eid="REV 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 10:6" />ekowha naiye unabupenyu businopela, wakabumba idenga naizwo zwose zwimo mwaili, nenyika naizwo zwose zwimo mwaili, negungwa naizwo zwose zwimo mwalili, kuti “Kusibane nokumwe kuchelejeka, <verse eid="REV 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 10:7" />koga kuti, mumazhuba okushomeja kolukwembo luchalijwa nengilozi yashanu nembili, chichenamiso chaMwali, sezwaka zibiswa kubashingi babe bapolofeti, chinokwelela kuzhajikijwa.”<verse eid="REV 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 10:8" />Pakalepo iwhi lindakabawha liva kudenga lyakalebeleka kwandili akale, liti, “Inda unotola lukwalo lulozhulwa muluboko lwengilozi imile mugugwa nopenyika.”<verse eid="REV 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 10:9" />Nokudalo ndakenda kungilozi ndikati indipe kakwalo katukutuku, iyo yakati kwandili, “Katole ukalye, kanozipa mundomo mumo sobuchi koga kemyonga muntumbu uwo,”<verse eid="REV 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 10:10" />Akale ndakakatola kakwalo katukutuku muluboko lwengilozi ndikakalya, kakabezipa swobuchi mundomo mwangu, koga pandakati ndakalya mutumbu mwangu mwakamyonga. <verse eid="REV 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 10:11" />Akale ndakabujwa kuti, “Iwi ulokwelela kupolofita akale nozwabanhu banji nenduji nendimi namashe.”<verse eid="REV 10:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="REV 11" />
  <para style="s">Basumikiji Babili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 11:1" />Pakalepo ndakapiwa unzato wokwelesa unanga sondozo, akale ndikabujwa, “Nyamuka upime itempeli lyaMwali nedebulilo naabo banonamatila imo, <verse eid="REV 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 11:2" />koga usupime lubazhe kuzhe kwetempeli, yolo ulusiye kuzhe, nokuti lulopilwa kunduji jokuzhe, akale banootoboka iguta ijena kwemyeji makumi mana anamibili. <verse eid="REV 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 11:3" />Akale, Imi ndoopa isimba kubasumikiji bangu babili kuti bepolofite kwamazhuba chiulu namazana mabili anamakumi mashanu ana limwe, bakambala masaka.”<verse eid="REV 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 11:4" />Yeyi ndiyo miti mibili yeoliva akale neezwi zwigajiko zwibili zwezwimuniko zwimile mbeli kwaTezi wenyika. <verse eid="REV 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 11:5" />Akale kana pelino unoda kubalwajisa ibo, moto unobhuda mundomo mwabo upalaja babengi babo, kana pelino umuda kubalwajisa, yoyo ulomisilwa kubulayiwa. <verse eid="REV 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 11:6" />Ibo banesimba lyokukonya idenga, kuti ivula isine nonshaji okupolofita kwabo, akale bana isimba pezhulu pevula kuyishandula iba ilopa, nokuzhaja inyika nemalajo, tunjinji sokuda kwabo.<verse eid="REV 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 11:7" />Pabachapeja busumikiji bwabo, ibhukanana lichava mudizwa linomila kusinojiba linoomusa ihondo nabo akale linoobazunda likababulaya, <verse eid="REV 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 11:8" />akale mitumbi yabo inolajikwa mungwagwa weguta igulwana linowhi mulungano Sodoma neIjipiti, kwakakahamililwa Tezi wabo panchinjikwa. <verse eid="REV 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 11:9" />Banhu bose banova kunyika, kulushobo, indimi nenduji jose banolingisisa mitumbi yabo bakafa, kwamazhuba matatu ana chikamu banolamba kuti ijikwe mugumbu. <verse eid="REV 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 11:10" />Yabo banogala penyika banooshanta pezhulu pabo akale banoosekelela bepana zwipo, nokuti yaba bapolofeti babili bakabeli bayabisi babagali bopenyika. <verse eid="REV 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 11:11" />Koga kwapinda mazhuba matatu ane chikamu lufemo lobupenyu luva kunaMwali lwakangwina mwabali, bakamilika bakama namakumbo abo, akale lutyo lukulwana kasa lwakaswikila yabo bakababona. <verse eid="REV 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 11:12" />Pakalepo bakawha iwhi lipezhulu liva kudenga liti kwabali, “Izhani yokuno!” Akale mumesho ababengi babo, bakenda kudenga belimugole. <verse eid="REV 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 11:13" />Ne awa yakaleyo kwakabana kudengeda kwenyika kukulwana kasa, chibabi chegumi cheguta chakakolomoka, zwiulu zwishanu nezwibili zwabanhu bakabulayiwa nokudengeda kwenyika, akale bose bamwe bakatya bakapa lukujo kunaMwali wokudenga.<verse eid="REV 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 11:14" />Isheto lyabili lyapinda, ilingani, isheto lyatatu likumuzha ngweno.<verse eid="REV 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukwembo lwashanu lunalubili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 11:15" />Pakalepo ingilozi yeshanhu inembili yakalija lukwembo lwayo, kukabana mawhi anoshomeja eva kudenga, eti, “Bushe bwenyika bwaba bushe bwaShe wedu, naKristo uwe, akale uchatonga kwemisi isinopela.” <verse eid="REV 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 11:16" />Bakulwana makumi mabili ana mana bakabeligele pezwigalo zwobushe mbeli kwaMwali bakalala nechiso bakanamata Mwali, <verse eid="REV 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 11:17" />beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">“Tomuboka Ishe Mwali Wamasimba, upo akale walubaipo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:17">kuti mwatola isimba lyenu igulwana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:17">kasakasa akale watanga kutonga.<verse eid="REV 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 11:18" />Inyika jakanyema,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">koga kunyema kuko kwakaswika,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">nonshaji wabakafa kuti betongwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">nokupa indipo kubashingi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">bapolofeti nabachena akale naabo banotya izina lilyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 11:18">bose bakulwana naba tukutuku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 11:18">akale nokupalaja bapalaji benyika.”<verse eid="REV 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 11:19" />Pakalepo itempeli lyaMwali kudenga lyakazhulwa, negwati lyechivumilano chiche lyakaboneka mukati mwetempeli lilye, pakalepo pakaba nokumweka kolupenyo, kunguluma, kudilima, kudengeda kwenyika nechivula mabwe chikulwana.<verse eid="REV 11:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="REV 12" />
  <para style="s">Unhukaji nebhuka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 12:1" />Akale chichenamiso chikulwana chakaboneka kudenga, unhukaji ulombajikwa izhuba, nomweji pasi pamakumbo awe, akale pansholo inhulu inenyenyeji igumi jinembili, <verse eid="REV 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 12:2" />wakabeli nemimba, akale elila nokumyongwa nemimba, elila elwajilwa konhu walebochila.<verse eid="REV 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 12:3" />Akale chimwe chitondejelo chakaboneka kudenga, ilingani, ibhuka igulwana ishaba, lina misholo mishanu ina mibili akale namabizho aligumi, akale newilemba zwishanu zwina zwibili pamisholo yalyo. <verse eid="REV 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 12:4" />Umwise walyo wakapyaila ukambweja chikamu chetatu chenyenyeji, jimbwejelwa penyika kuva kudenga. Akale ibhukanana lyakama mbeli kwonhukaji wakabalebo chila, kuti lilye mwana uwe paachachilwa. <verse eid="REV 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 12:5" />Wakachila mwananhulumyana, iye uchatonga inyika jose neswimbo yensimbi, mwana uwe wakanantulwa kunaMwali kuchibhula chiche chobushe. <verse eid="REV 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 12:6" />Unhukaji yoyo wakatizhila mugwegulu, kuli iko kuna bugalo bwaakalongelwa naMwali, akale kwaachawana kulondotwa kulokwelela kwamazhuba chiulu namazana mabili ana makumi mashanu ana limwempela.<verse eid="REV 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 12:7" />Nezwo kwakabana nehondo kudenga. Mayikolo nengilozi jije belwana nebhukanana, akale ibhukanana nengilozi jalo lyakabwiliza, <verse eid="REV 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 12:8" />koga bakazundwa, bakalashikilwa nobugalo bwabo bugalo bwabo kudenga. <verse eid="REV 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 12:9" />Ibhukanana igulwana lyakaposelwa pasi, inyokehulu yantolontolo, inoshobwa kuwhi Guluzhanje kana kuti Satani, unchengeli wenyika yose. Waposelwa pasi penyika, pamwempela nengilozi jije.<verse eid="REV 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 12:10" />Pakalepo ndakawha iwhi lyopezhulu liva kudenga liti, “Ngweno luchijo nesimba nobushe bwaMwali wedu nesimba lyaKristo uwe zwaswika, nokuti umpomeli unopomela banakwaina bedu pambeli paMwali wedu busiku namasikati waposelwa pasi. <verse eid="REV 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 12:11" />Bakonkoma nelopa lyeMhwizana akale newhi lyobusumikiji bwabo, nokuti abajaka fwifwinyala nokutya lufu beda bupenyu bwabo. <verse eid="REV 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 12:12" />Shantani feno, imwi matenga namwi banogala mwakale! Koga masheto kwamuli, kunyika negungwa, nokuti guluzhanje wezha pasi kwamuli nokunyema kukulwana, nokuti unoziba kuti unshaji uwe umfupi!”<verse eid="REV 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 12:13" />Ibhukanana palyakabona lyakaposelwa pasi penyika, lyakatatamila unhukaji wakabachila mwana unhulumyana. <verse eid="REV 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 12:14" />Unhukaji wakapiwa mapapilo mabili echipungu chikulwana kuti epululuke esiye inyoka ende kugwegulu, kubugalo bwakalonganyilwa kwachalondotwa zwibuyanana konshaji, nemishaji, nokwe chikamu chonshaji, kusino swikwa nenyoka <verse eid="REV 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 12:15" />Inyoka yakafha ivula yakakunga solwizi, ikatobela unhukaji, kuti ivula yupindile indembeli kukwe iuntole. <verse eid="REV 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 12:16" />Koga inyika yakabhancha unhukaji, inyika yakashama ikaminya lwizi lwakabava mundomo webhukanana. <verse eid="REV 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 12:17" />Pakalepo ibhukanana lyakanyemela unhukaji, lyakenda kunotanga ihondo nenzwalo yonhukaji yose, kunaabo banolondota milawo yaMwali akale besumikija Jesu. <verse eid="REV 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 12:18" />Ibhukanana lyakama ponsenche wegungwa.<verse eid="REV 12:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="REV 13" />
  <para style="s">Zwibanda zwibili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 13:1" />Akale ndakabona chibanda chifumpuka chibhuda mugungwa, chinamabizho aligumi nemisholo mishanu ina mibili, nenhulu igumi pamabizho acho nezina linotuka Mwali pamisholo yacho. <verse eid="REV 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 13:2" />Chibanda chindakabona chakabeli sengwe, makumbo acho eli sebhele, undomo wacho wakabeli soweshumba. Ibhukanana lyakapa chibanda masimba alyo nechibhula chobushe nobutongi bukulwana. <verse eid="REV 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 13:3" />Umwe wemisholo yacho wakabeboneka soti una chilonda chikulwana kasa, koga chilonda chacho chikulwana kasa chakabachila, akale inyika yose yakachenamiswa nechipuka ikachitobela. <verse eid="REV 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 13:4" />Banhu bakanamata ibhukanana, nokuti lyakabaapa chipuka butongo bwalyo, akale banhu bakanamata chibanda, beti, “Ndiyani unanga sechibanda, akale ndiyani angalwana nacho!”<verse eid="REV 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 13:5" />Akale chipuka chakapiwa undomo wakalebeleka mawhi okuzwikuja nokutuka Mwali, akale chakavumilwa kushingisa butongi kwemyeji makumi mana ana mabili. <verse eid="REV 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 13:6" />Chakazhula undomo wacho kutuka Mwali, kutuka izina lilye nobugalo bubwe, yezwi zwili, yabo banogala kudenga.<verse eid="REV 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 13:7" />Akale chakavumilwa kulwana ihondo nabachena baMwali akale nokubazunda. Akale butongi chakabupiwa pezhulu pemishobo yose, yabanhu, yendimi akale nenyika. <verse eid="REV 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 13:8" />Bose banogala penyika banoochinamata chibanda, wose unezina lisanu lyakwalwa muwhalo yeMhwizana yobupenyu, iMhwizana yakabulayiwa kuvila kumatangisilo okubumbwa kwenyika.<verse eid="REV 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 13:9" />Yoyo unenzebe, ngewhe. <verse eid="REV 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 13:10" />Kana pelina bachatapwa, kubutapwa unonda, kana pelina umwe uchabulayiwa negwalabaza, negwalabaza banobulayiwa. Yoku kushobelela kokusimatija kuna kugontama nokudimbwa kubachena baMwali.<verse eid="REV 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 13:11" />Pakalepo ndakabona chimwe chibanda, chakabhuda chiva munyika. Chakabeli namabizho mabili semhwizana, koga chakabelebeleka sebhukanana. <verse eid="REV 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 13:12" />Icho chakashingisa isimba lyose lyechibanda chotanga icho chilipo, akale chikata kuti inyika nabagali bayo benamate chibanda chotanga, chechilonda chikulwana chakabachila. <verse eid="REV 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 13:13" />Chibanda chabili chakata zwitondejelo zwikulwana, nokubhisa moto kuva kudenga uzha pasi banhu bose bakalinga. <verse eid="REV 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 13:14" />Chakachenga bagali bopenyika, nezwitondejelo zwachakavumilwa kuti chite chakamililila chibanda chokutanga. Chakabalayija kuti bete chibumbwa chokukuja chibanda chakabalwajiswa negwalabaza koga chikachila. <verse eid="REV 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 13:15" />Chibanda chabili chakapiwa isimba, kupa lufemo kuchibumbwa chechibanda chotanga kuti chibumbwa chechibanda chotanga chitubule kulebeleka, akale chita bose basinonamata chibumbwa chechibanda bebulayiwe. <verse eid="REV 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 13:16" />Chakabhata nesimba banhu bose, bakulwana nabatukutuku, balofuma nabasheti, balosungunuka nabalanda, kuti betemulwe imhande kumaboko abo olulyi kana pehuma jabo. <verse eid="REV 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 13:17" />Kutila kuti pesibe nouchatenga kana kushambaja esina nemhande, ndilo izina lyechibanda kana chilabo chilomilila izina.<verse eid="REV 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 13:18" />Yezwi zwinoda buchenjevu. Yoyo unhu unowhisisa ngezibe chilabo chechibanda, nokuti chilabo yechi chilomilila izina lyomwe unhu. Chilabo yechi mazana mashanu ane mwempela namakumi mashanu ana limwempela nechishanu china chimwempela.<verse eid="REV 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="REV 14" />
  <para style="s">Imhwizana Nabanhu Babe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 14:1" />Pakalepo ndakalinga, pedunhu lyeZioni pakabelimile iMhwizana, akale nayo kwakabelimile izana lyozwiulu nezwiulu makumi mana nezwiulu zwina zwabanhu, bakakwalwa izina lilye nelyaTate babe pehuma jabo. <verse eid="REV 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 14:2" />Akale ndakawha iwhi linanga sontimbo sevula yamapopoma iva kudenga, akale nokudilima kwevula. Izhoba lyandakawha lyakabeli sabaliji botudende belija tudende twabo. <verse eid="REV 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 14:3" />Akale bakakwimba lwimbo lupya mbeli kwechibhula chobushe nambeli kwezwibumbwa zwina zwipenyu nambeli kwabakulwana. Apana wakaluziba lwimbo yolo kuzhe kwezana lyozwiulu namakumi mana ozwiulu anazwiulu zwina bakachijwa munyika. <verse eid="REV 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 14:4" />Yaba ndibo banhulume basakabanu bashangana nabanhukaji, ibo yaba baloshambijika, yaba ndibo banotobela iMhwizana kwose kwainonda, yaba bakachijwa mubanhu semichelo yotanga yaMwali neMhwizana. <verse eid="REV 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 14:5" />Apana iniepwa lyakawanikwa mumilomo yabo, nokuti abana chibi pabali.<verse eid="REV 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ingilozi inhatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 14:6" />Pakalepo ndakabona imwe ingilozi ipululuka mumpepo mudenga lyopakati, iline ndebo imbuya isinopela yokupupula kunaibo bose banogala munyika, kuna ijo jose inyika, nenduji jose, nendimi jose, nabanhu bwose, <verse eid="REV 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 14:7" />yakati newhi lyopezhulu, “Ityani Mwali akale muumpe lukujo, nokuti iawa yontongo uwe yaswika. Namatani iye wakabumba idenga, nenyika, igungwa namashawi evula.”<verse eid="REV 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 14:8" />Ingilozi, yabili yakatobela iti, “Yawa! Yawa iBhabhiloni ihulwana, iyo yakata kuti jose inyika jinwe iwayini yezwi lakamilo zwayo zwobusangu.”<verse eid="REV 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 14:9" />Akale imwe ingilozi yatatu yakajitobela iti newhi lyopezhulu, “Kana pelino unonamata chibanda nechibumbwa chacho, nokutambula imhande yacho pehuma kana poluboko lulwe, <verse eid="REV 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 14:10" />yoyo neebo unoonwa iwayini yokunyetela kwaMwali, idilwa munkombe wokunyetela kukwe isa lelupiswa, akale unooyabiswa nomoto nesalifa inopisa mbeli kwengilozi inchena nambeli kweMhwizana. <verse eid="REV 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 14:11" />Akale busi bokuyabiswa kwabo bunoofhunga bunda pezhulu kwemisi isinopela. Banamati bechibanda nechibumbwa chacho akale noyo unotambula imhande yezina lyacho, abatooba nolunyetutuko busiku kana masikati.”<verse eid="REV 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 14:12" />Yoku kushobelela kokusimatija kokugontama kwabachena, yabo banolondota milawo yaMwali akale nokudimbwa kunaJesu.<verse eid="REV 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 14:13" />Pakalepo ndakawha iwhi liva kudenga liti, “Kwala yezwi, Balokombolelwa yabo bachafa befila munshingo waTezi kuvila unshaji yono zwindila mbeli!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 14:13">uMpepo unoleba “Eya chokomende!” “Muminshingo yabo mikukutu banoonyetutukwa mulushanto, nokuti mishingo yabo inoobatobela.”<verse eid="REV 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvunwa kwenyika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 14:14" />Ndakalinga ndikabona igole ijena pambeli pangu akale umwe unanga soMwananhulumyana wonhu wakabeligele pegole, eline nhulu yendalama pansholo uwe, akale nechibaza chinopiza muluboko lulwe. <verse eid="REV 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 14:15" />Akale imwe ingilozi yakabhuda mutempeli, ishomeja newhi lyopezhulu kunaiye wakabeligele pegole, “Tola chibaza chicho, uvune, nokuti unshaji wokuvuna waswika, nokuti zwokuvuna penyika zwayiva zwilopelela.” <verse eid="REV 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 14:16" />Nokudalo yoyo wakaba eligele pegole wakavukuja chibaza chiche penyika, inyika ikavunwa.<verse eid="REV 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 14:17" />Akale imwe ingilozi yakabhuda mutempeli kudenga, naiyo bo yakabelina nechibaza lilopiza.<verse eid="REV 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 14:18" />Pakalepo yakabhuda imwe ingilozi yakabeli noshingo wokulinga moto mudebulilo, akale ikashomeja newhi lyopezhulu kuneeyo yakabeli nechibaza chilopiza, “Shingisa chibaza chicho chilopiza, ucheke zwikata zwonzhambi penyika, nokuti michelo yonzhambi yayiva.” <verse eid="REV 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 14:19" />Ingilozi yakavukuja chibaza chayo penyika ikabutitika zwikata zwonzhambi zwopenyika ikazwiposela muchiswinilo chikulwana cholunyemo lwaMwali. <verse eid="REV 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 14:20" />Zwikata zwemichelo yonzhambi zwakabetobokwa muchiswinilo kuzhe kweguta, akale ilopa lyakakunga likanyamuka liva muchiswinilo, likatana bulefu bokuswika muzwimilo zwebhiza, likakunga zwinamazana angaba matatu amakilomita.<verse eid="REV 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="REV 15" />
  <para style="s">Ingilozi jempalajo yopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 15:1" />Pakalepo ndakabona chimwe chitondejelo kudenga, chikulwana akale chinochenamisa, ingilozi ishanu jinembili jiline mpalajo ishanu jinembili, jili ijo jopejeleja, nokuti munaijo kunyetela kwaMwali kunopejwa.<verse eid="REV 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 15:2" />Akale ndakabona zwakaba zwilingika segungwa lyamagilazi liloshanganiswa nomoto, akale yabo bakabakoma chibanda nechibumbwa chacho, nechilabo chezina lyacho, belimile kumbali kwegungwa lyamagilazi notudende twaMwali mumaboko abo, <verse eid="REV 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 15:3" />akale bekwimba lwimbo lwaMozesi, unshingi waMwali, nolwimbo lweMhwizana beti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">“Zwikulana akale zwinochenamisa zwito zwizwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">Tezi Mwali Wamasimba.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:3">Jilolulama akale ngejechokomende inzila jijo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:3">She wenduji jose!<verse eid="REV 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 15:4" />Ndiyani angasotya iwi Tezi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">akale ebuza lukujo kuzina lilyo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">Iwi woga ndiwi unchena.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 15:4">Jose induji jinoozha</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">akale jinamata mbeli kuko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 15:4">nokuti mishingo iyo mibuya yatondejelwa.”<verse eid="REV 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 15:5" />Kwapinda yezwi ndakalinga, ndikabona itempeli, lilitente lyakazhulika kudenga lililyobusumikiji bomulawo, lyakabakazhulwa, <verse eid="REV 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 15:6" />akale mutempeli mwakabhuda ingilozi ishanu jinembili jiline mpalajo ishanu jinembili. Jakabakambala micheka iloshambijika, inopenya, akale zwifuba zwajo zwakabakasungwa namabhanti endalama. <verse eid="REV 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 15:7" />Pakalepo chimwe chezwibumbwa zwina zwipenyu, chakapa ingilozi ishanu jinembili imbiya jendalama jizhele lunyetelo lwaMwali, iye upenyu kwemisi isinopela. <verse eid="REV 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 15:8" />Itempeli lyakazhala busi bwakava mukungaima kwaMwali nomumasimba Awe, akale apana walutubula kungwina mutempeli kuswikila impalajo ishanu jinembili jengilozi ishanu jinembili japela.<verse eid="REV 15:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="REV 16" />
  <para style="s">Imbiya Inshanu Jinembili Jolunyetelo lwaMwali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 16:1" />Pakalepo ndakawha iwhi lyopezhulu liva mutempeli libuja ingilozi ishanu jine mbili, liti “Indani munyika munodila imbiya ishanu jinembili jolunyetelo lwaMwali!”<verse eid="REV 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 16:2" />Ingilozi yokutanga yakenda ikakutulila penyika imbiya yayo, kukaba nezwilonda zwibi zwinolwaja zwakagala pabanhu bakabeli nemhande yechibanda benamata chibumbwa chacho.<verse eid="REV 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 16:3" />Ingilozi yabili yakakutulila imbiya yayo mugungwa, likashanduka likaba selopa lyonhu wakafa, akale chose chinhu chipenyu mugungwa chakafa.<verse eid="REV 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 16:4" />Ingilozi yatatu yakakutulila munjizi nomumashawi evula imbiya yayo, akale zwikaba ilopa. <verse eid="REV 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 16:5" />Pakalepo ndakawha ingilozi yakabelondota ivula iti, “Imwi mulolulama, Imwi muNchena, Imwi mupo akale mwakabelipo, mulolulama mumitongo yeyo! <verse eid="REV 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 16:6" />Nokuti banhu bakakutula ilopa lyabachena nelabapolofeti, akale iwi wabapa ilopa kuti benwe senkwelelo yabo!” <verse eid="REV 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 16:7" />Akale ndakawha idebulilo lishandula liti, “Eya, She Mwali Wamasimba, mitongo iyo ngiye chokomende akale ilolulama!”<verse eid="REV 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 16:8" />Ingilozi yechina yakakutulila imbiya yayo pezhuba, akale izhuba lyakavumilwa kupisa banhu nomoto. <verse eid="REV 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 16:9" />Banhu bakanyezwa nokupisa kunotyisa, akale bakafhizha izina lyaMwali, iye wakabeli namasimba pezhulu pempalajo yeji, akale ajakashanduka nokuunkuja.<verse eid="REV 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 16:10" />Ingilozi yeshanhu yakakutulila imbiya yayo pechigalo chobushe bwechibanda, bushe bwacho bwakaba munhilima. Banhu bakazwiluma tulimi twabo nokulwajilwa, <verse eid="REV 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 16:11" />akale bakafhizha Mwali wokudenga nokulwajilwa akale nezwilonda zwabo, koga abajaka shanduka muzwito zwabo zwibi.<verse eid="REV 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 16:12" />Ingilozi yeshanu inemwempela yakakutulila imbiya yayo mulwizi lukulwana iYufuletisi, akale ivula yalo ikakomelela, kulikubambanyila inzila yamashe anova kubuvezhuba. <verse eid="REV 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 16:13" />Pakalepo ndakabona mipepo mitatu mibi yakabelingika sezwizhulwa, yakava mundomo webhukanana, nomundomo wechibanda nomundomo wompolofeti woniepa. <verse eid="REV 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 16:14" />Yeyi ndiyo mipepo yamadimoni, imuta zwitondejelo, imunda kuzhe kumashe enyika jopasi lyose, kubabunganisila ihondo nezhuba igulwana lyaMwali Wamasimba.<verse eid="REV 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 16:15" />“Ilingani, Ndimuzha sembava! Ulokombolelwa iye ulobhwazula akale akambala ingubo jije kuti esikwende chinkuna akale nokuswabiswa kokuboneka eli alo!”<verse eid="REV 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 16:16" />Akale mipepo yakababunganya mashe pabugalo bunowhi muchi Hebhelu Amagedoni. <verse eid="REV 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 16:17" />Ingilozi yechishanu nembili yakakutulila imbiya yayo mumpepo, akale iwhi lipopezhulu lyakava mutempeli, liva pechigalo chobushe, liti “Zwapela!” <verse eid="REV 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 16:18" />Pakalepo kwakaboneka kumweka kolupenyo, kunguluma, kudilima kwevula, akale nokudengeda kwenyika kukulwana zwisakabanu zwaboneka kuvila banhu baba penyika, yoko kuteketa kwenyika kwakabeli kukulwana kasakasa. <verse eid="REV 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 16:19" />Iguta igulwana lyakakwamulwa likabazwibabi zwitatu, namakuta enyika akawa, naMwali akakumbulukwa iBhabhiloni igulwana, wakalipa unkombe wokunyema kukwe kukulwana. <verse eid="REV 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 16:20" />Akale zwose zwibongo zwakatizha, namatunhu aajaka bechinowanikwa, <verse eid="REV 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 16:21" />akale chivulamabwe chikulwana chobulemu bungaba makumi mashanu amakilogilamu chimwe nechimwe, chivula mabwe chiva kudenga chakambwelela pezhulu pabanhu, kuswikila banhu bafizha Mwali pezhulu pempalajo yechivulamabwe, yakabeli impalajo inotyisa.<verse eid="REV 16:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="REV 17" />
  <para style="s">Ivemu linozibikana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 17:1" />Pakalepo imwe yengilozi ishanu jinembili jakabeli nembiya ishanu nembili yakezha kwandili ikati, “Izha, ndookutondeja kulangwa kwevemu igulwana ligele pezhulu pevula inji, <verse eid="REV 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 17:2" />mashe openyika bakapombola nalyo, nabagali bopenyika bakakolwa newaini yobupomboli bwalyo.”<verse eid="REV 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 17:3" />Ndili mumpempo ingilozi yakandinyamula ikenda nami mugwegulu, ndakabona unhukaji eligele pechibanda chishaba chakabelizhele mazina okutukaMwali, akale chili nemisholo mishanu inamibili namabizho aligumi. <verse eid="REV 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 17:4" />Unhukaji wakabakambala zwensulubele akale zwishaba, ekapenyeswa nendalama nobushongo namabwe mabhodo, akabhata muluboko lulwe ikomechi yendalama izhele zwinosheshemisa neshambwa yobupomboli bubwe, <verse eid="REV 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 17:5" />pehuma iye pabakakwalwa izina linoleba zwilosisika zwinoti, “Bhabhiloni igulwana, mai bamavemu ose akale nezwi sheshemeso zwopenyika.” <verse eid="REV 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 17:6" />Akale ndakabona iye unhukaji yoyu, akakolwa nelopa lyabachena akale nelopa lyakasumikijila Jesu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 17:6">Pandakoombona ndakachenama zwikulwana kasakasa. <verse eid="REV 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 17:7" />Koga ingilozi yakati kwandili, “Ini zwaukumuchenama? Ndokubuja isiswa lyonhukaji nelechibanda chinamisholo mishanu ina mibili akale namabizho ali gumi chalotana. <verse eid="REV 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 17:8" />Chibanda chiwabona chakabelipo, akale achichipo, akale chinofumpuka chiva mudizwa lisinojiba akale chinda kukujiila kwemisi isinopela, akale bagali penyika bana mazina asilokwalwa muwhalo yobupenyu kuvila kumatangisilo enyika, banoochenama kubona chibanda, nokuti chakabelipo koga achichipo asi chichinoozha kabili.<verse eid="REV 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 17:9" />“Yezwi zwinoda indangalilo ina buchenjevu nokuwhisisa. Misholo mishanu ina mibili matunhu mashanu ana mabili paanogala unhukaji yoyu. <verse eid="REV 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 17:10" />Ndiwo bo mashe mashanu ana mabili, mashanu akawa, umwempela upo, umwe aajanhu ezha, paachezha unokwelela kubayipo konshaji unshomanana. <verse eid="REV 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 17:11" />Chibanda chakabelipo akale chisichipo, icho ndiche chishanu nenhatu koga eli umwe wamashe mashanu ana mabili, akale unonda kukupalajwa kukwe.<verse eid="REV 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 17:12" />“Akale mabizho makumi yaya awakabona mashe ali gumi asanu aponchwa bushe, koga banootambula isimba lobutongi samashe kwe awa imwempela, pamwempela nechibanda. <verse eid="REV 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 17:13" />Yaba banendangalilo imwempela banopa isimba lyabo nobutongi bwabo kuchibanda. <verse eid="REV 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 17:14" />Ibo banoomusa ihondo neMhwizana, akale iMhwizana inoobazunda, nokuti iye ndiTezi wamatezi akale ndiShe wamashe, akale yabo bayiko kwaali baloshobwa, nokushalwa akale balobimbika.”<verse eid="REV 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 17:15" />Ingilozi yakati kwandili, “Ivula yawabona, yopo pagele ivemu ilomililila banhu, luvute, inyika akale nendimi. <verse eid="REV 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 17:16" />Akale mabizho makumi awakabona, iwo nechibanda banoobenga ivemu, banoonta kuti ebe ega ebechinkuna, belye inyama iye akale boompise nomoto, <verse eid="REV 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 17:17" />nokuti Mwali wakazwibiga mumyoyo yabo kuti bete chinangwa chiche beli nendangalilo imwempela akale bepa masimba abo obushe kuchibanda, kuswikila mawhi aMwali azhajikijwa.<verse eid="REV 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 17:18" />“Akale unhukaji yoyu wawakabona ndilyo iguta igulwana linotonga mashe openyika.”<verse eid="REV 17:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="REV 18" />
  <para style="s">Kuwa kweBhabhiloni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 18:1" />Mushule mwezwi ndakabona imwe ingilozi izha iva kudenga, ili namasimba makulwana kasakasa, akale inyika yakapenyeswa noku ngaima kwayo. <verse eid="REV 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 18:2" />Akale yakashomeja newhi linesimba igulwana, “Yawa, yawa iBhabhiloni ihulwana kasakasa! Yaba bugalo bwamadimoni, bugalo bunotyisa bwemipepo mibi yose, bugalo bunotyisa bwenyuni jineshambwa, bugalo bunotyisa bwemhuka jineshambwa akale jibengwa, <verse eid="REV 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 18:3" />nokuti inyika jose jakanwa iwaini yolulakamilo lweshambwa lwayo, akale mashe openyika bakapombola nayo, nabashambaji bose bopenyika bakafumiswa noluchibo lusina kuzwibhata.”<verse eid="REV 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 18:4" />Pakalepo ndakawha limwe iwhi liva kudenga liti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:4">“Banhu bangu bhudani muna iye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Musishanganyile muluchinyo lulwe!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:4">Musishanganyile mukulangwa kukwe,<verse eid="REV 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 18:5" />nokuti luchinyo lulwe lulobutitikwa zwilefu zwokuswika kudenga,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:5">akale Mwali wakumbulukwa inzila jije imbi.<verse eid="REV 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 18:6" />Muumbate nenzila yakamubhata nayo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:6">muumbwilizile zwilopamwa kabili sezwito zwizwe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:6">Muudilile zwilopamwa kabili zwinova munkombe uwe.<verse eid="REV 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 18:7" />Unjabiseni kasa akale muumpe kulila kukulwana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">solukujo nefuma, iyo yaakazwipa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Mumwoyo uwe unozwitunha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">eti, ‘Ndigele pechigalo chobushe sashekaji!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:7">Anditoba inchilikaji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:7">anditoofa ndalila.’<verse eid="REV 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 18:8" />Nokudalo impalajo jije jinoonswikila mezhuba limwempela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">malwaji, kulila, nezhala.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="REV 18:8">Unoopiswa nomoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="REV 18:8">nokuti unamasimba makulwana She Mwali, iye uchootonga.”<verse eid="REV 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 18:9" />Mashe openyika, bakapombola naye akale bakakobana nayo kutangala kokugalika, banoolila nokufwikula pezhulu payo bachabona busi bokupya kwayo, <verse eid="REV 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 18:10" />banoomila kule, betya kuyabiswa kukwe, akale beti, “Mayee! Mayee! Iwi iguta igulwana, iwi iguta linesimba igulwana, Bhabhiloni! Mu awa imwempela untongo uwo waswika!”<verse eid="REV 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 18:11" />Akale bashambaji bopenyika bamufwikula nokundilila kwayo, nokuti apana uchinotenga zwibiya zwabo, <verse eid="REV 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 18:12" />apachina unotenga indalama, isiliva, mabwe alokosha, bulungu bulokosha, micheka mibuya yensulubele, inhete inotejemuka, neyiloshapalila, akale mishobo yose yezwikunyana zwinonhuwhilila, zwose zwibezhwa zwembizho, akale nozwezwikunyana zwinodula, insimbi yengula, insimbi namabwe emabhulu, <verse eid="REV 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 18:13" />nesinamoni, nobuthwilo, ifhungaijo, imule, idubha, iwaini, mafuta e oliva, buswa bwakapandulwa, ikoloni nengombe nemhwizi, mabhiza nengolo jehondo, nabalanda, akale nobupenyu bwabanhu. <verse eid="REV 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 18:14" />Banooti, “Michelo yabelakamilwa nompepo uwo yabhuda mwauli. Bose bubhodo nokuyebeka kuko kwakanyangalika, azwichinoowanika akale!” <verse eid="REV 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 18:15" />Bashambaji bezwibiya yezwi, bakawana bufumi kwalili, banoomila kule, betya kuyabiswa kwayo, befwikula akale belila, <verse eid="REV 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 18:16" />akale beshomeja beti, “Masheto! Masheto! Kunawi guta igulwana yakabakambajikwa micheka mibhodo, yensulubele neshaba, ilopenyeswa nendalama, mabwe alokosha akale nobulungu bulokosha! <verse eid="REV 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 18:17" />Muawa imwempela bufumi bose yobu bwakapalajwa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 18:17">Akale bose batungamili bobwato, bakwendi bomubwato akale nabanhu banoshingila mubwato, naibo bose banoshambaja mubwato, bakamila kule. <verse eid="REV 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 18:18" />Bakakwiila pabakabona busi bokupya kwayo, “Ndilipi iguta lyabeli seguta igulwana?” <verse eid="REV 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 18:19" />Akale bakazwidila ihuluba mumisholo yabo, belila befwikula, beshomeja beti, “Masheto! Masheto kunawi, iguta igulwana! Nokuti pezhulu pefuma yalyo bose bakabeli nobwato mugungwa bakafuma. Mu awa imwempela lyakapalajwa.”<verse eid="REV 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 18:20" />Shanta pezhulu palyo, iwi denga! Shantani imwi bachena! Shantani bapositoli nabapolofeti! Nokuti Mwali woopa untongo waakabepa kwamuli.<verse eid="REV 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 18:21" />Pakalepo ingilozi inamasimba makulwana yakatola ibwe linanga iziyo igulwana ikaliposela mugungwa, iti, “Ndiyo inzila ichaposwa nayo pasi nesimba iBhabhiloni iguta igulwana, alitoowanikwa akale. <verse eid="REV 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 18:22" />Kulila kotudende, mitetele, mikwembo, nokukwimba kwabanhu azwitoowhikana akale mwauli. Apana imhizha yemishingo ipi zwayo ichawanikwa mwauli akale. Nokutimba kweziyo akuchinoowhikana mwauli akale, <verse eid="REV 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 18:23" />nontutumo wechimuniko auchinoomunika mwauli akale. Namawhi ondoboli nondobolwa aatowhikana mwauli akale. Bashambaji babo bakabeli banhulume bakulwana penyika. Nefumbo lilyo inyika jose jakalashika.”<verse eid="REV 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 18:24" />Munailyo mwakawanikwa ilopa lyabapolofeti nelyabachena baMwali, nelyaibo bose bakabulayiwa penyika.<verse eid="REV 18:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="REV 19" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 19:1" />Mushule mwezwi ndakawha sewhi lipezhulu lyoluvute lukulwana lwabanhu bokudenga beshomeja, beti, “Haleluya! Luchijo, kungaima nesimba ngozwaMwali wedu, <verse eid="REV 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 19:2" />nokuti butongo bubwe ngobwe chokomende nokululama. Wakapa untongo kuvemu igulwana lyakaswibhisa inyika nobupomboli bwalyo, akale wakabwilizila pana ilyo ilopa lyabashingi babe.” <verse eid="REV 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 19:3" />Bakashomeja kwechibili beti, “Haleluya! Busi bunova kuna iyo bunonda pezhulu kwemisi isinopela.” <verse eid="REV 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 19:4" />Akale bakulwana makumi mabili nabana, nezwibumbwa zwina zwipenyu, bakawila pasi bakanamata Mwali wakabeligele pechigalo chobushe, beti, “Ameni. Haleluya!”<verse eid="REV 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Miliya yokulobola kweMhwizana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 19:5" />Akale kuva muchibhula chobushe kwakawhika iwhi lishomeja, liti, “Kujani Mwali wedu, imwi mose bashingi babe, imwi munoontya, bakulwana nabatukutuku.” <verse eid="REV 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 19:6" />Pakalepo ndakawha zwakaba zwili sewhi loluvute igulwana, sontimbo wevula inji akale sokudilima kukulwana kolupalanganda, beshomeja beti, “Haleluya! Nokuti She Mwali wedu wamasimba umutonga. <verse eid="REV 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 19:7" />Atishanteni tishantisise akale tipelukujo kuna iye, nokuti kulobola kweMhwizana kwaswika, akale undobolwa uwe wazwilonganyila. <verse eid="REV 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 19:8" />Wakavumilwa iye kuti embajikwe ingubo joncheka umbodo, unopenya akale uloshambijika. Uncheka umbodo, zwito zwilolulama zwabachena.”<verse eid="REV 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 19:9" />Akale ingilozi yaMwali yakati kwandili, “Kwala yezwi uti, Balokombolelwa yabo balokokwa kumiliya yokulobola kweMhwizana.” Ingilozi yakati kwandili, “Yaya mawhi echokomende aMwali.”<verse eid="REV 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 19:10" />Pakalepo ndakafugama pamamukumbo awe kuunamata, koga iye wakati kwandili, “Usizwite yezwi! Imi ndili umwe wabashingi sawi akale ndimwanakwaina uwo ulobhata busumikiji bwaJesu. Namata Mwali.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 19:10">Nokuti busumikiji bwaJesu ndiwo umpepo wobupolofita.<verse eid="REV 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Untanhi webhiza ijena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 19:11" />Pakalepo ndakabona idenga likazhulika, akale mbeli kwangu kuli nebhiza ijena! Iye wakabakaligada unowhi Kubimbika Nechokomende, mubululami unotonga akale undwani wehondo. <verse eid="REV 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 19:12" />Mesho awe ananga sontutumo womoto, akale munsholo mumwe muna zwilemba zwinji, akale unezina lilokwalwa lisinozibwa nonhu kuzhe kukwe iye. <verse eid="REV 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 19:13" />Ulombala chimbalo chakanjovekwa mulopa, akale izina lilye linowhi, “iWhi lyaMwali.” <verse eid="REV 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 19:14" />Makapo abalwi bokudenga, ekambala ingubo jemicheka mibuya, michena akale iloshambijika, akoontobela eli pamabhiza machena. <verse eid="REV 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 19:15" />Mundomo mumwe munobhuda igwalabaza lilopiza lyokubulaya nalyo induji, akale unoobatonga nonzato wensimbi, unootoba chiswinilo chewaini nobukali bokunyetela kwaMwali Wamasimba Ose. <verse eid="REV 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 19:16" />Pechimbalo chiche akale nopedumbi lilye palokwalwa izina, She wamashe akale Tezi wamatezi.<verse eid="REV 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 19:17" />Pakalepo ndakabona ingilozi ilimile muzhuba, akale newhi lipopezhulu yakashomeja kunyuni jose jinopululuka mudenga lyopakati, “Izhani, bunganilani miliya mikulwana yaMwali, <verse eid="REV 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 19:18" />koolya inyama yemibili yamashe, neyabatungamilili babalwi, neyabanhulume banesimba, neyamabhiza akale nabagadi bawo, neyabanhu bose balosungunuka nabalanda, bakulwana nabatukutuku.”<verse eid="REV 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 19:19" />Akale ndakabona chibanda akale namashe enyika namakapo abo abalwi bakabungana kumusa ihondo noyo ulogada ibhiza nabalwi babe. <verse eid="REV 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 19:20" />Kwakabhatwa chibanda akale nompolofeti wamaniepwa wakata zwitondejelo icho chilipo zwili izo zwakachengela yabo bakatambula imhande yechibanda akale bakanamata chibumbwa chacho. Yaba babili bakaposelwa mugandwa lyomoto unopisa nesalifa belibapenyu. <verse eid="REV 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 19:21" />Bamwe bose bakabulaiwa negwalabaza linobhuda mundomo moyo ulotana ibhiza. Inyuni jose jakagutisisa nenyama yombili wabo.<verse eid="REV 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="REV 20" />
  <para style="s">Chiulu chamakole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 20:1" />Pakalepo ndakabona ingilozi idelela pasi iva kudenga, yakabhata muluboko ikii yedizwa lisinojiba neketani ihulwana. <verse eid="REV 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 20:2" />Ingilozi yakabhata ibhukanana, yendiya inyoka yantolo, uli iye guluzhanje akale ewhi Satani, akale akoonsunga kwamakole chiulu, <verse eid="REV 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 20:3" />ingilozi yakoomposela mudizwa lisinojiba, akale ikalikonya ikalinama pezhulu pape, kuti esichengeje induji akale, kuswikila chiulu chamakole chapinda. Mushule mwezwi unokwelela kusungunulwa konshaji unshomanana.<verse eid="REV 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 20:4" />Pakalepo ndakabona zwibhula zwobushe, akale bakabeligele panaizwo bakabeli yabo bakabakapiwa utongo. Akale ndakabona mipepo yaabo bakabadumulwa misholo pezhulu pokupa busumikiji bwabo nezwaJesu, newhi lyaMwali. Yaba ndibo basijakanamata chibanda kana chibumbwa chacho nokuso tambula imhande yacho pehuma jabo kana pamaboko abo. Bakamuka, akale bakatonga naKristo kwechiulu chamakole. <verse eid="REV 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 20:5" />Bose bamwe bakafa abajakamuka kuswikila kupela kwechiulu chamakole. Yoku ndikokumuka kubafi kotanga. <verse eid="REV 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 20:6" />Balokombolelwa akale bachena ibo banomuka pamwempela nabo banoomuka kubafi kotanga! Pezhulu pabananga saaba lufu lwabili aluna masimba, koga bachaba batebuji baMwali akale baKristo, akale banootonga naye kwechiulu chamakole.<verse eid="REV 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomwa kwaSatani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 20:7" />Chiulu chamakole chingopela, Satani unoobhiswa muntolongo lilye, <verse eid="REV 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 20:8" />unoonda kuzhe koochengela inyika jimo mumatibi mana enyika, ndikokuti, Gogu naMagogu, kubabunganijila ihondo, bunji bwabo bunanga sonsechelele wegungwa. <verse eid="REV 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 20:9" />Akale bakakwabaila pezhulu penyika bupabi bwayo akale bakakomboloja unshasha wabachena akale neguta linodikana, koga moto wakava kudenga wakabapalaja, <verse eid="REV 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 20:10" />akale Guluzhanje wakabachengela, wakaposelwa mugandwa igulwana lyomoto nesalifa mwakaba muline chibanda nompolofeti woniepa, akale banoosheteswa busiku namasikati kwemisi isinopela.<verse eid="REV 20:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Untongo wopejeleja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 20:11" />Pakalepo ndakabona chibhula chikulwana chichena chobushe akale nowakaba eligele panaicho, idenga nenyika zwakatizha mbeli kwechiso chiche. akale apajakawanikwa bugalo bwabo. <verse eid="REV 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 20:12" />Ndakabona bakafa, bakulwana nabatukutuku, belimile mbeli kwechigalo chobushe, akale makwalo akazhulwa. Akale lumwe lukwalo lwakazhulwa, ilo luli lukwalo lwobupenyu. Akale bakafa bakatongwa nezwakabakakwalwa mumakwalo, pezhulu pezwito zwabo. <verse eid="REV 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 20:13" />Akale igungwa lyakashikula bakabafila munailyo, Lufu nobugalo lwabakafa zwakabulula bakafa munaizwo, akale bose bakatongwa nezwito zwabo. <verse eid="REV 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 20:14" />Pakalepo Lufu nobugalo lwabakafa zwakaposelwa mugandwa lyomoto. Yolu ndilo lufu lwabili, igandwa lyomoto, <verse eid="REV 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 20:15" />akale kana izina lyani kana aani lisakawanikwa likakwalwa mulukwalo lyobupenyu, wakaposelwa mugandwa likulwana lyomoto.<verse eid="REV 20:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="REV 21" />
  <para style="s">Idenga ibhya nenyika impya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 21:1" />Pakalepo ndakabona idenga ibhya akale nenyika impya, nokuti idenga lyotanga akale nenyika yotanga zwakabapinda, akale negungwa alijakabechipo. <verse eid="REV 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 21:2" />Ndakabona iguta ijena, iJelusalema impya, lizha libhuluka liva kudenga kunaMwali, likabambanyilwa sondobolwa ulocheneselwa undume uwe, <verse eid="REV 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 21:3" />Ndakawha iwhi lishomeja liva muchibhula chobushe liti, “Linga, bugalo bwaMwali bwaba mubanhu. Unoogala nabo, akale banooba banhu babe, akale Mwali nokukwe unooba nabo, akale unoba Mwali wabo. <verse eid="REV 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 21:4" />Unoochumula mishoji yose mumesho mwabo, akale kufa, kufwikula, kulila nokulwajilwa akutobaipo, nokuti zwinhu zwantolo zwakapinda.”<verse eid="REV 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 21:5" />Iye wakabeligele pechigalo chobushe wakati, “Linga, ndikumuta zwinhu zwose bupya.” Akale wakati, “Kwala yezwi, nokuti mawhi yaya alobimbika akale ichokomende.” <verse eid="REV 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 21:6" />Akale wakati kwandili, “zwapela! Imi ndimi Alufa naOmega, matangisilo nokujiba. Kuna unenyota ndopa ivula pasina indipo, iva mushawi lyevula yobupenyu. <verse eid="REV 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 21:7" />Iye unozunda unoowana ifuma yeyi, akale ndooba Mwali uwe akale iye unooba mwananhulumyana wangu. <verse eid="REV 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 21:8" />Koga bana bubhempele, basilobimbika, baloswibhiswa, babulayi, bapomboli, balowi, banamati bezwimwali, akale nabaniepi bose, unkobelo wabo unobeli mugandwa linamoto unopisa nesalifa, luli ilo lufu lwabili.”<verse eid="REV 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">IJelusalema impya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 21:9" />Pakalepo kwakezha ingilozi imwempela yejingilozi ishanu jinembili jakabeline mbiya ishanu jinembili jizhele imhalajo jopejeleja, akale yakalebeleka nami, iti, “Izha, ndikutondeje uNdobolwa, unkaji weMhwizana.” <verse eid="REV 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 21:10" />Akale ndangwina muMpepo yakandinyamula ikandisenga kudunhu igulwana, ilefu, ikanditondeja iJelusalema iguta ijena, libhuluka liva kudenga kunaMwali, <verse eid="REV 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 21:11" />lili nokungaima kwaMwali, kupenya kwalo kuli sebwe lilokosha, linanga sejasipa, ijena ilobelengela sevula. <verse eid="REV 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 21:12" />Lyakabeli nobulambo bukulwana kasa, bulefu, lilina mashubo igumi namabili, pamashubo pakabeli nengilozi igumi nembili, akale pamashubo pakabe pekakwalwa mazina enduji igumi jinembili jabana banhulumyana baIzilayeli, <verse eid="REV 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 21:13" />Pakabelina mashubo pamapazu ose eguta, kubuvezhuba mashubo matatu, kuluteka mashubo matatu, kuchampembwe mashubo matatu, akale kubumililo mashubo matatu. <verse eid="REV 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 21:14" />Bulambo bweguta bwakabelina zwimisikilo igumi nezwibili, akale panaizo pabakakwalwa mazina abalayijwa baligumi nababili beMhwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 21:15" />Akale iye yoyo wakalebeleka nami wakabelina kakombo kendalama kotala kuti etale iguta namashubo alyo akale nobulambo. <verse eid="REV 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 21:16" />Iguta ligele pabugalo bunokwelana namapazu mana, bulefu bunokwelana nobwasha, akale wakatala iguta nakakombo kake, bulefu, bwasha nobulefu bwazhezhulu zwose zwikwelana akawana zwingaba makumi mabili ozwiulu namazana mabili amakilomita. <verse eid="REV 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 21:17" />Ingilozi yakatala bulambo, ishingisa kutala konhu kungaba makumi mashanu negumi amamita. <verse eid="REV 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 21:18" />Bulambo bwakabakabakwa namabwe anokosha ijasipa, ilyo iguta lili lyendalama imbuyanana, ilongwejemuka segilazi. <verse eid="REV 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 21:19" />Zwimisikilo zwobulambo bweguta zwakabakacheneswa namabwe ose alokosha, lyotanga lyakaba lilishaba, lyabili safaya, lyatatu lilikalikidoni, lyechina lili iemelalidi, <verse eid="REV 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 21:20" />lyashanu lili ionikisi, lyashanu lina limwempela lili ikanaliyani, lyashanu lina mabili lili ikilisolaiti, lyashanu linamatatu ibhelili, lyashanu linamana itopazi, lgumi ikilisofulezi, igumi linemwepela ijasinti, igumi linatubili iamateisiti. <verse eid="REV 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 21:21" />Akale mashubo igumi linamabili akabeli bulungu bulokosha, limwe nelimwe ishubo lyakaba lyakatiwa nobulungu bulokosha bumwempela, akale ungwagwa weguta wakaba uli wendalama imbuyanana, ilobelengela segilazi.<verse eid="REV 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="REV 21:22" />Akale andijakabona itempeli muguta, nokuti itempeli lyalyo ndiShe Mwali waMasimba neMhwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="REV 21:23" />Akale iguta alijakabeshaka izhuba kana mweji kuti zwilimunikile, nokuti kungaima kwaMwali ndiwo mwenje walyo, akale chimuniko chalyo iMhwizana. <verse eid="REV 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="REV 21:24" />Nomwenje walyo inyika jichakwenda, namashe enyika achabuza bukulwana bwawo mwachili, <verse eid="REV 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="REV 21:25" />mashubo alyo aatokonywa masikati akale akutooba nobusiku kwakale, <verse eid="REV 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="REV 21:26" />banoobuza mwalili kungaima akale nolulemekejo lwenyika. <verse eid="REV 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="REV 21:27" />Koga apana kana chineshambwa chichangwina mwalili, kana aani unota zwisheshemeso kana maniepwa, koga chete yabo balokwalwa muwhalo yobupenyu yeMhwizana.<verse eid="REV 21:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="REV 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="REV 22:1" />Pakalepo ingilozi yakanditondeja lwizi lwevula yobupenyu, inobelengela sekristali, ikunga iva muchibhula chobushe chaMwali akale necheMhwizana, <verse eid="REV 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="REV 22:2" />lupinda pakati pongwagwa weguta. Akale mumapazu ose olwizi, kumile miti yobupenyu nemichelo yayo iligumi nemibili, izwala michelo yayo mweji nomweji, akale mazhani onti akabeli okuchilisa inyika. <verse eid="REV 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="REV 22:3" />Apachinobana nozwifhizhwo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:3">Chibhula chobushe chaMwali necheMhwizana zwinoba zwili mukati mwalyo iguta, akale banoonshingila bashingi babe. <verse eid="REV 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="REV 22:4" />Banoobona chiso chiche, akale izina lilye linooba lili pehuma jabo. <verse eid="REV 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="REV 22:5" />Akale apatooba pechina busiku, abatooda kumunika kwechimuko kana kwezhuba, nokuti Iye She Mwali unooba mwenje wabo, akale banootonga kwemisi isinopela.<verse eid="REV 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzha kwaJesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="REV 22:6" />Ingilozi yakati kwandili, “Yaya mawhi alobimbika akale ichokomende. She, Mwali wemipepo yabapolofeti, watuma ingilozi iye kutondeja bashingi babe zwinokwelela kutikana nokukambijisa.”<verse eid="REV 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="REV 22:7" />“Ilinga, ndikumuzha nokukambijisa. Ulokombolelwa iye unolondota mawhi obupolofeti bwewhalo yeyi.”<verse eid="REV 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="REV 22:8" />Imi Joni ndimi ndakawha akale ndikabona yezwi zwinhu. Akale pandakazwiwha, ndikazwibona, ndakawa nechiso pamakumbo engilozi yakanditondeja yezwi kuti ndinamate, <verse eid="REV 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="REV 22:9" />koga yakati kwandili, “Autokwelela kuta yezwi! Imi ndinshingikwaina uwo akale nabanakwaina babo bapolofeti, naabo banolondota mawhi omuwhalo yeyi. Namata Mwali.” <verse eid="REV 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="REV 22:10" />Akale wakati kwandili, “Usikonye mawhi obupolofeti bwewhalo yeyi, nokuti unshaji waba pelyo. <verse eid="REV 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="REV 22:11" />Lekeja unota bubi endilembeli eta bubi, unosheshemesa endilembeli eta zwinosheshemesa, akale ulolulama endilembeli eta bululami, akale unchena endilembeli elinchena.”<verse eid="REV 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="REV 22:12" />“Ilinga, ndikumuzha nokukambijisa, ndibuza indipo yangu, koolipa umwenoumwe nezwaakata. <verse eid="REV 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="REV 22:13" />Ndimi Alifa akale Omega, wotanga akale opejeleja, matangisilo akale namapejelejo.”<verse eid="REV 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="REV 22:14" />Balokombolelwa yabo banopopa ingubo jabo, kuti bebe nendulamilo kunti wobupenyu akale kuti bengwine muguta nopamashubo. <verse eid="REV 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="REV 22:15" />Kuzhe kunembwa, banozana ifumbo, nabapomboli, nababulayi nabanonamata zwibezhwa, akale neniepi.<verse eid="REV 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="REV 22:16" />“Imi Jesu ndatuma ingilozi yangu kunamwi nobusumikiji yobu kumakubungano. Imi ndimi chizekululu akale inzwalo yaDavidi, inyenyeji inopenya yezhingwanangwana.”<verse eid="REV 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="REV 22:17" />UMpepo noNdobolwa banoti, “iZha.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:17">Akale iye yoyo umuwha ngeti, “iZha.” Akale iye yoyo unenyota ngezhe, iye yoyo unozwimbuja ngetole ivula yobupenyu pesina undipo.<verse eid="REV 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapejelejo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="REV 22:18" />Imi Joni ndimuchenjeja wose unowha mawhi obupolofeti bwewhalo yeyi, kana pelina uchapamija kunaiwo, Mwali unoopamijila kwaali impalajo jilo pandululwa muwhalo yeyi, <verse eid="REV 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="REV 22:19" />akale kana umwe angobhisa zwimwe mumawhi ewhalo yobupolofeti bwalyo, Mwali unoontolela inkobelo iye munti obupenyu nomuguta ijena, zwilobandwa muwhalo yeyi.<verse eid="REV 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="REV 22:20" />Iye unosumikija kunezwi zwinhu unoti, “Chokomende ndikumuzha nokukambijisa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="REV 22:20">Ameni. Izha Tezi Jesu!<verse eid="REV 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="REV 22:21" />Chipiwo chaTezi Jesu chibe nabanhu bose.<verse eid="REV 22:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="REV 22" />
</usx>